  "description": "<p>For NonRDFResources that have an \"acl:accessControl\" triple in their metadata,   acl link header is missing.   To resolve,  the acl:accessControl triple must be extracted from the resource/fcr:metadata and returned in the response header.  c.f.<a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#link-rel-acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#link-rel-acl</a></p>",
